#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:7
msgid ""
"Channels are where you connect, collaborate, and communicate with your "
"team about various topics or projects. Use channels to organize "
"conversations across different topics. as you're :doc:`sending messages "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/send-messages>`, :doc:`replying to messages "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/reply-to-messages>`, and :ref:`participating"
" in conversation threads <end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-"
"conversations:start or reply to threads>`."
msgstr ""
"채널은 다양한 주제나 프로젝트에 대해 팀과 연결하고, 협업하고, 소통하는 곳입니다. "
":doc:`메시지 보내기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/send-messages>`, :doc:`메시지에 "
"답글 달기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/reply-to-messages>`, :ref:`대화 스레드에 "
"참여 <end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-conversations:start or reply to "
"threads>`\\ 를 하면서 채널을 사용하여 다양한 주제에 걸쳐 대화를 정리하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:10
msgid "You're added to default channels automatically"
msgstr "기본 채널에 자동으로 추가됩니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:12
msgid ""
"Everyone who joins a Mattermost :doc:`workspace </end-user-guide/end-"
"user-guide-index>` is automatically added to the **Town Square** channel."
" See our :doc:`Channel Types </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types>`"
" documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST :doc:`워크스페이스 </end-user-guide/end-user-guide-index>`\\ 에 "
"참여하는 모든 사람은 자동으로 **Town Square** 채널에 추가됩니다. 자세한 내용은 "
":doc:`채널 유형 </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types>` 문서를 "
"참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:15
msgid ""
"The Town Square channel can't be :ref:`archived <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels:archive a channel>` or "
":doc:`converted to a private channel </end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/convert-public-channels>`, and users can't :ref:`leave <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels:leave a channel>` this default "
"channel. However, :doc:`guests </administration-guide/onboard/guest-"
"accounts>` who are manually invited to **Town Square** can leave the "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"Town Square 채널은 :ref:`보관 <end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-"
"channels:archive a channel>`\\ 하거나 :doc:`비공개 채널로 변환 </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/convert-public-channels>`\\ 할 수 없으며, 사용자는 이 기본 "
"채널을 :ref:`나갈 <end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels:leave a "
"channel>` 수 없습니다. 그러나 **Town Square**\\ 에 수동으로 초대된 :doc:`게스트 "
"</administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>`\\ 는 채널을 나갈 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:18
msgid "Channel sidebar"
msgstr "채널 사이드바"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:20
msgid ""
"In the channel sidebar on the left, you'll find all of the the channels "
"you're a member of as well as useful channel management tools. See the "
":doc:`channel types </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types>` to learn"
" about the types of channels available, how they work, and how to "
"identify them in the channel sidebar. Learn how to create channels by "
"visiting the :doc:`create channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/create-"
"channels>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"왼쪽의 채널 사이드바에서 구성원으로 있는 모든 채널과 유용한 채널 관리 도구를 찾을 수 "
"있습니다. 사용 가능한 채널 유형, 작동 방식, 채널 사이드바에서 식별하는 방법에 대해 "
"알아보려면 :doc:`채널 유형 </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types>`\\ 을 "
"참조하세요. 채널을 만드는 방법은 :doc:`채널 만들기 </end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/create-channels>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:22
msgid ""
"As your channel sidebar fills up with channels you've joined, you can "
"organize your channels into categories based on how you work. See the "
":doc:`customize your channel sidebar </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/customize-your-channel-sidebar>` documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"채널 사이드바가 참여한 채널로 채워지면, 작업 방식에 따라 채널을 카테고리로 정리할 수 "
"있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :doc:`채널 사이드바 사용자 지정 </end-user-guide"
"/preferences/customize-your-channel-sidebar>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:25
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "자세히 알아보기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:27
msgid "Learn more about collaborating within Mattermost channels:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 채널 내에서 협업하는 방법에 대해 자세히 알아보기:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:52
msgid ""
":doc:`Channel naming conventions </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"naming-conventions>` - Learn why channel names are important."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 이름 지정 규칙 </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-naming-"
"conventions>` - 채널 이름이 중요한 이유를 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:53
msgid ""
":doc:`Communicate a channel's focus and scope </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-header-purpose>` - Learn how to communicate a "
"channel's scope and focus."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널의 초점과 범위 전달 </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-header-"
"purpose>` - 채널의 범위와 초점을 전달하는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:54
msgid ""
":doc:`Browse channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/browse-channels>` - "
"Browse all available public channels you can join, and all channels "
"you're a member of."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 둘러보기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/browse-channels>` - 참여할 수 "
"있는 모든 공개 채널과 구성원으로 있는 모든 채널을 둘러보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:55
msgid ""
":doc:`Join and leave channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-"
"channels>` - Learn how to start or stop being a channel member."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 참여 및 나가기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels>` - "
"채널 구성원이 되거나 그만두는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:56
msgid ""
":doc:`Make calls in Mattermost </end-user-guide/collaborate/make-calls>` "
"- Learn how to start, join, and attend calls in Mattermost, as well as "
"screen share."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST에서 통화하기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/make-calls>` - "
"OKR.BEST에서 통화를 시작하고, 참여하고, 참석하는 방법과 화면 공유 방법을 "
"알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:57
msgid ""
":doc:`Navigate between channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/navigate-"
"between-channels>` - Learn how to navigate between channels."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 간 이동 </end-user-guide/collaborate/navigate-between-channels>` - "
"채널 간 이동 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:58
msgid ""
":doc:`Create channels </end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels>`  - "
"Create channels to organize discussion by topic, project, or focus."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 만들기 </end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels>`  - 주제, "
"프로젝트, 또는 초점별로 토론을 정리하기 위해 채널을 만드세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:59
msgid ""
":doc:`Rename a channel </end-user-guide/collaborate/rename-channels>` - "
"Rename channels to make them more discoverable."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 이름 변경 </end-user-guide/collaborate/rename-channels>` - 채널을 더 "
"쉽게 찾을 수 있도록 이름을 변경하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:60
msgid ""
":doc:`Display channel banners </end-user-guide/collaborate/display-"
"channel-banners>` - Display a fixed banner at the top of channels to warn"
" users about the presence of classified or sensitive information."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 배너 표시 </end-user-guide/collaborate/display-channel-banners>` - "
"기밀 또는 민감한 정보의 존재를 사용자에게 경고하기 위해 채널 상단에 고정된 배너를 "
"표시하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:61
msgid ""
":doc:`Auto-translate messages </end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-"
"messages>` - Automatically translate channel messages into your preferred"
" language."
msgstr ""
":doc:`메시지 자동 번역 </end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages>` - "
"채널 메시지를 선호하는 언어로 자동으로 번역하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:62
msgid ""
":doc:`Convert public channels to private channels </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/convert-public-channels>` - Learn how to convert "
"channel access and visibility."
msgstr ""
":doc:`공개 채널을 비공개 채널로 변환 </end-user-guide/collaborate/convert-public-"
"channels>` - 채널 액세스와 가시성을 변환하는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:63
msgid ""
":doc:`Convert group messages to private channels </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/convert-group-messages>` - Learn how to convert group "
"messages to private channels."
msgstr ""
":doc:`그룹 메시지를 비공개 채널로 변환 </end-user-guide/collaborate/convert-"
"group-messages>` - 그룹 메시지를 비공개 채널로 변환하는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:64
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage channel members </end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-"
"members>` - Add and remove users from channels."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 구성원 관리 </end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-members>` - "
"채널에서 사용자를 추가하고 제거하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:65
msgid ""
":doc:`Mark channels as favorites </end-user-guide/collaborate/favorite-"
"channels>` - Mark commonly visited channels as favorites."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널을 즐겨찾기로 표시 </end-user-guide/collaborate/favorite-channels>` - "
"자주 방문하는 채널을 즐겨찾기로 표시하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:66
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage channel bookmarks </end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-"
"channel-bookmarks>` - Manage quick access links or files pinned to the "
"top of channels."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 북마크 관리 </end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks>` "
"- 채널 상단에 고정된 빠른 액세스 링크나 파일을 관리하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:67
msgid ""
":doc:`Mark channels as unread </end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-channels-"
"unread>` - Mark channels unread to return to messages later."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널을 읽지 않음으로 표시 </end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-channels-"
"unread>` - 나중에 메시지로 돌아가기 위해 채널을 읽지 않음으로 표시하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-channels.rst:68
msgid ""
":doc:`Archive and unarchive channels </end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/archive-unarchive-channels>` - Keep the number of available channels "
"manageable."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 보관 및 보관 해제 </end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-"
"channels>` - 사용 가능한 채널 수를 관리 가능하게 유지하세요."

